# Everything not excluded here is sent to the build daemon and can end up in the image.
#
# `data/` is the entry that matters beyond image size: conversation exports and archives live
# there, it is untracked, and it must never reach a built artifact (constitution, Principles I
# and V). The rest is weight and noise.
#
# tests/structure/test_image_definition.py asserts that .git, tests, specs and data stay listed.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes

data
tests
specs
docs
.specify
.claude

.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gitleaks.toml
